          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For dedicated sprint work, a curved trainer is the better tool, and the
            <strong class="text-white">SOLE C80 Curved Manual Treadmill</strong> is the one we would choose for most
            people: no top speed, no motor lag, magnetic resistance and a 19 in. deck. The Tru Grit Runner suits
            resisted pushes, and the SB Fitness CT400 is the lower-priced option.
          </p>
