            If you also run easy miles and hills, buy a motorised treadmill instead. The
            <strong class="text-white">NordicTrack Commercial 2450</strong> reaches 14 mph, and the Horizon 7.4 AT
            changes pace quickly for intervals up to 12 mph. Either way, start with the sessions in our
